#### B. Background Sync API
For mobile browsers, the `online` event might not fire if the app is closed. Use the **[Service Worker Background Sync API](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Background_Sync_API)**. It allows the browser to defer the sync until the user has a stable connection, even if the app is closed.

#### C. Data Integrity
*   **UUIDs:** Generate IDs on the client side (using `crypto.randomUUID()`) rather than waiting for the server to assign an ID. This allows you to link related records (e.g., photos to a survey) while offline.
