### 5. Automatic Reconnection Listener
Add this to your main `App.js` or `index.js` to trigger the sync automatically when the browser detects a connection.

```javascript
useEffect(() => {
  const handleOnline = () => {
    console.log("Back online! Syncing...");
    syncData();
  };

  window.addEventListener('online', handleOnline);
  return () => window.removeEventListener('online', handleOnline);
}, []);
```

